ource, all articles. The recent history was from \"Controlled Web\". So these are new content not previously recommended.\n\nLet me select 5 diverse \"条件与原理\" candidates. I'll pick across different dishes and different contexts for variety.\n\nLet me choose:\n1. item-0ac37da79bac - 蒸鱼：工作日备餐中的条件与原理\n2. item-20d117d62c34 - 番茄炒蛋：两人晚餐中的条件与原理\n3. item-0ef03b868945 - 鸡胸肉口感：小份试做中的条件与原理\n4. item-1f7a4e5259fb - 蔬菜焯水：小份试做中的条件与原理\n5. item-2bd3f1c7d71a - 面团发酵：家庭周末午餐中的条件与原理\n\nThese cover 5 distinct dishes, all principle/condition type which the user has consistently liked.\n\nLet me publish.","type":"text"},{"arguments":{"items":[{"candidateId":"evaluation:candidate:item-0ac37da79bac","recommendationReason":"你此前对多篇“条件与原理”类烹饪文章都点了喜欢，而这篇蒸鱼文章正是解释水分、温度与食材结构如何共同影响口感，契合你对烹饪原理的关注。"},{"candidateId":"evaluation:candidate:item-20d117d62c34","recommendationReason":"番茄炒蛋是家常菜中检验火候与水分控制的典型，本文以两人晚餐为背景讲解条件与原理，符合你关注可复现做法和烹饪原理的偏好。"},{"candidateId":"evaluation:candidate:item-0ef03b868945","recommendationReason":"你偏好原理类内容，这篇鸡胸肉口感文章从小份试做切入，说明水分、温度与食材结构如何影响口感，能帮你理解食材处理背后的机制。"},{"candidateId":"evaluation:candidate:item-1f7a4e5259fb","recommendationReason":"蔬菜焯水涉及食材处理的关键条件，本文以小份试做为背景比较不同处理方式的作用边界，与你关注食材处理和烹饪原理的兴趣一致。"},{"candidateId":"evaluation:candidate:item-2bd3f1c7d71a","recommendationReason":"面团发酵是原理性较强的家常烘焙主题，本文在家庭周末午餐场景下解释水分、温度与结构如何影响结果，延续了你对“条件与原理”类内容的偏好。"}]},"id":"call_00_OuejbFDJjcXCB9jyLbGh1055","name":"publish_recommendations","type":"toolCall"}],"model":"deepseek-v4-flash","provider":"deepseek","rawStopReason":"tool_calls","responseId":"21bc1133-2b9e-4275-8f33-4583ee9a532b","role":"assistant","stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1788851043780,"usage":{"cacheRead":1280,"cacheWrite":0,"cost":{"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"input":0,"output":0,"total":0},"input":22117,"output":1817,"reasoning":0,"totalTokens":25214}}},"correlation":{"requestId":"evaluation:resume-preference.cooking-u2:recommendation-request:1","executionId":"evaluation:resume-preference.cooking-u2:execution:1","modelCallId":"eva